SPRINT 2 - RATIO ENGINE EDGE CASE LOG
Project: NIFTY 100 Financial Analytics
Sprint: Sprint 2 - Financial Ratio Engine
Date: 23-09-2026

============================================================
1. PROFITABILITY RATIO EDGE CASES
============================================================

1.1 Zero Sales
Affected KPIs:
- Net Profit Margin (NPM)
- Operating Profit Margin (OPM)

Handling:
If sales = 0, the ratio is returned as NULL/None to prevent
division-by-zero errors.

Status: HANDLED


1.2 Non-Positive Equity
Affected KPI:
- Return on Equity (ROE)

Equity definition:
equity_capital + reserves

Handling:
If total equity <= 0, ROE is returned as NULL/None.

Status: HANDLED


1.3 Zero Capital Employed
Affected KPI:
- Return on Capital Employed (ROCE)

Handling:
If capital employed = 0, ROCE is returned as NULL/None.

Status: HANDLED


1.4 Zero Total Assets
Affected KPI:
- Return on Assets (ROA)

Handling:
If total_assets = 0, ROA is returned as NULL/None.

Status: HANDLED


1.5 OPM Source Cross-Check
Calculated OPM was compared against the source OPM percentage.

Actual result:
PASS     = 854 rows
MISMATCH = 216 rows

A difference greater than the configured tolerance is flagged
as MISMATCH rather than silently overwritten.

Status: HANDLED


============================================================
2. LEVERAGE AND EFFICIENCY EDGE CASES
============================================================

2.1 Debt-Free Companies
If borrowings = 0, Debt-to-Equity can legitimately equal 0.

Status: HANDLED


2.2 Invalid/Non-Positive Equity
Debt-to-Equity is not calculated where the equity denominator
is invalid.

Status: HANDLED


2.3 Financial-Sector Leverage
Financial-sector companies naturally operate with different
leverage structures.

Actual financial-sector rows:
258

Handling:
These rows are marked SECTOR_RELATIVE instead of applying the
normal high-leverage interpretation.

Status: HANDLED


2.4 High Leverage
Actual HIGH_LEVERAGE rows:
87

Handling:
Non-financial companies crossing the configured leverage
threshold are explicitly flagged HIGH_LEVERAGE.

Status: HANDLED


2.5 Zero Interest Expense
Interest Coverage Ratio cannot be calculated using normal
division when interest expense is zero.

Handling:
Debt-free cases are classified separately rather than
generating infinity.

Status: HANDLED


2.6 Interest Coverage Warning
Actual ICR_WARNING rows:
135

Handling:
Low interest-coverage observations are explicitly flagged.

Status: HANDLED


2.7 Net Debt Source Limitation
Required formula:
Net Debt = Borrowings - Cash/Cash Equivalents

Problem:
The supplied source dataset does not provide a dedicated cash
or cash-equivalent field.

Handling:
Net Debt was NOT fabricated using an unrelated field.

Result:
net_debt = NULL
net_debt_status = SOURCE_CASH_FIELD_UNAVAILABLE

Status: SOURCE LIMITATION DOCUMENTED


============================================================
3. CAGR EDGE CASES
============================================================

CAGR windows implemented:
- 3 Year
- 5 Year
- 10 Year

Metrics:
- Revenue
- PAT
- EPS

Historical endpoints are matched using actual fiscal-year
values rather than simple row positions.

Supported edge cases:

Positive -> Positive:
CAGR calculated normally.
Flag: NORMAL

Positive -> Negative:
CAGR not mathematically represented as normal growth.
Flag: DECLINE_TO_LOSS

Negative -> Positive:
Flag: TURNAROUND

Negative -> Negative:
Flag: BOTH_NEGATIVE

Zero starting value:
Flag: ZERO_BASE

Required historical endpoint unavailable:
Flag: INSUFFICIENT

Status: HANDLED


5-Year CAGR availability:

Revenue CAGR 5Y = 612 rows
PAT CAGR 5Y     = 549 rows
EPS CAGR 5Y     = 545 rows


